From 7bf51f4458ce3de0b3f7b675a9c4fd5567521542 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:27:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] uts: Add host-managed instance resource view

Bind an instance cgroup once to a noninitial UTS namespace. Use the same
accounting for native/compat sysinfo, proc and host snapshots; fail when
the bound cgroup goes offline. Keep the original 48/48/512-byte ABI.

Add a separate 256-byte memory snapshot for reclaim, refault and virtual
zone watermarks. Supply the fields and text structure consumed by LMKD
without exposing host zone, IRQ, slab, block or swap identities.
Unbound namespaces retain their original behavior.

Kernel base: e8694cdbd7db99fa26f6e8c80a2a337e0de29a2f (6.18.53)
